COPY public.institutions (id, name, slug, description, history, type, ownership, logo_url, cover_image_url, website_url, email, phone, address, city, region, latitude, longitude, accreditation, status, created_at, updated_at) FROM stdin;
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004	Jimma University	jimma-university	Established through the merger of the Jimma Institute of Health Sciences (1983) and the Jimma College of Agriculture (1952), Jimma University in the Oromia Region is internationally recognized for its Community-Based Education (CBE) philosophy. JU is a leading national research university in Medicine, Public Health, Environmental Engineering, Agriculture, and Natural Sciences, operating the Jimma University Specialized Hospital, modern agronomy research centers, and cutting-edge biotechnology laboratories.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607237138185-eedd9c632b0b?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.ju.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Jimma	Oromia	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018	Wolkite University	wolkite-university	Public university in Wolkite.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519452635265-7b1fbfd1e4e0?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.wku.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Wolkite	South Ethiopia	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-21 00:21:40.691394-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008	Adama Science and Technology University	adama-science-and-technology-university	Chartered in 1993 and designated as a national center of excellence for science and technology, ASTU is located in Adama, Oromia Region. ASTU operates with a specialized mandate to advance technological innovation, STEM education, and industrialization in Ethiopia, focusing on Applied Engineering, Computational Sciences, Materials Science, and Robotics. The campus boasts advanced manufacturing workshops, semiconductor and nanotechnology testing labs, and industrial incubator hubs.	\N	university	public	assets/logos/astu_logo.png	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.astu.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Adama	Oromia	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.801654-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009	St. Mary's University	st-marys-university	Private higher education institution.	\N	university	private	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492538368677-f6e0afe31dcc?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.smuc.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Addis Ababa	Addis Ababa	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010	Addis Ababa Medical and Business College	addis-ababa-medical-and-business-college	Private higher education institution.	\N	college	private	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	\N	\N	\N	\N	Addis Ababa	Addis Ababa	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001	Addis Ababa University	addis-ababa-university	Established in 1950 as the University College of Addis Ababa, AAU is the premier national research university and oldest higher learning institution in Ethiopia. Operating across multiple specialized campuses in Addis Ababa (Sidist Kilo, Arat Kilo, Tikur Anbessa), AAU is recognized for its academic excellence across Engineering, Health Sciences, Computational Sciences, Law, Social Sciences, and Business Economics. AAU hosts the Tikur Anbessa Specialized Hospital, the Institute of Ethiopian Studies, advanced biomedical research facilities, and over 70 undergraduate and 200 graduate degree programs.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541339907198-e08756dedf3f?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.aau.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Addis Ababa	Addis Ababa	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002	Bahir Dar University	bahir-dar-university	Established in 1953 as the Poly-Technic Institute and chartered as a comprehensive university in 2000, Bahir Dar University is located along the shores of Lake Tana in the Amhara Region. BDU is a national flagship institution renowned for the Bahir Dar Institute of Technology (BiT), the Maritime Academy, the School of Law, and the College of Medicine and Health Sciences. The university features extensive engineering testing laboratories, Lake Tana hydrology research centers, advanced textile engineering complexes, and agricultural research farms.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.bdu.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Bahir Dar	Amhara	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003	University of Gondar	university-of-gondar	Founded in 1954 as the Public Health College and Training Center, the University of Gondar is renowned as Ethiopia pioneer in community-based public health and medical education. Situated in the historic city of Gondar, Amhara Region, UoG excels across Medicine, Health Sciences, Veterinary Medicine, Natural Sciences, and Humanities. It operates the comprehensive Gondar Comprehensive Specialized Hospital, modern clinical simulation laboratories, and international research collaborations in infectious disease epidemiology and rehabilitation sciences.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564981797816-1043664bf78d?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.uog.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Gondar	Amhara	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005	Hawassa University	hawassa-university	Established in 1976 and chartered as a comprehensive university in 2000, Hawassa University is located in the scenic Rift Valley capital of the Sidama Region. HU is a designated center of excellence in Agricultural Sciences, Forestry, Natural Resources, Medicine, Technology, and Business Economics. HU hosts extensive agro-forestry research forests, the Hawassa University Comprehensive Specialized Hospital, and advanced laboratories for industrial chemistry, biosciences, and lake ecosystem studies.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498243691581-b145c3f54a5a?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.hu.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Hawassa	Sidama	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006	Mekelle University	mekelle-university	Founded in 1993 as the Arid Zone Agricultural College and elevated to university status in 2000, Mekelle University is situated in Mekelle, Tigray Region. MU has grown into a major research institution renowned for Dryland Agriculture and Natural Resource Management, Water Harvesting Technology, Public Health, Law, and Mining Engineering. MU features modern geological research facilities, the Ayder Comprehensive Specialized Hospital, veterinary teaching clinics, and specialized arid-zone research stations.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519452635265-7b1fbfd1e4e0?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.mu.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Mekelle	Tigray	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007	Arba Minch University	arba-minch-university	Founded in 1986 as the Water Technology Institute (WTI), Arba Minch University in the South Ethiopia Region is the premier center of excellence for Water Resources Engineering, Hydrology, Irrigation, and Meteorology in the Horn of Africa. The university offers advanced academic programs in Civil Engineering, Agricultural Sciences, Natural Sciences, and Health, housing hydraulic modeling flumes, meteorological observation stations, and specialized limnology research laboratories.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509062522246-3755977927d7?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.amu.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Arba Minch	South Ethiopia	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-16 02:36:03.225282-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011	Haramaya University	haramaya-university	Established in 1954 in collaboration with Oklahoma State University, Haramaya University in the Oromia Region is Ethiopia historic agricultural pioneer. The institution has expanded into a comprehensive research center specializing in Agronomy, Animal Sciences, Agribusiness, Health Sciences, Law, and Technology. Haramaya operates extensive experimental farms, seed research centers, biotechnology complexes, and the Hiwot Fana Comprehensive Specialized Hospital in Harar.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.haramaya.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Haramaya	Oromia	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-21 00:21:40.691394-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015	Dire Dawa University	dire-dawa-university	Established in 2006, Dire Dawa University is located in the vibrant commercial charter city of Dire Dawa in eastern Ethiopia. DDU focuses heavily on Engineering, Technology, Railway Engineering, Business & Economics, and Health Sciences. Given its strategic location along the Addis Ababa-Djibouti trade corridor, DDU hosts modern transport logistics labs, civil engineering test facilities, and emerging digital technology innovation centers.	\N	university	public	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80	https://www.ddu.edu.et	\N	\N	\N	Dire Dawa	Dire Dawa	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-08-21 00:21:40.691394-07	2026-08-22 14:57:42.792413-07
